From 1d88fd6352ad4394ed3a3c205c2f142f2328b660 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex Agent <codex-agent@invalid>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 02:27:46 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] Keep page buffer ownership and native frame metadata
 together

Move pending and committed page ownership, fence transfer and native metadata through one production frame helper. Retain the same allocation without clearing its rebuilt texture, then return its release credit once at real replacement. Reassert ordinary sRGB import state per update and clear reusable target native metadata before each render attempt.

Prepare actual GDK texture, descriptor-ownership and allocation-credit transition coverage, plus GPU one-pixel extended-colour readback. Compilation and tests remain unexecuted.
